GET http://localhost:4004/CatalogService/

###Read Service Metadata
GET http://localhost:4004/CatalogService/$metadata

###Read all the data from SalesOrders
GET http://localhost:4004/CatalogService/SalesOrders

###Read top 2 data after skipping 2 data from SalesOrders
GET http://localhost:4004/CatalogService/SalesOrders?$top=2&$skip=2

###Reading data from SalesOrders with related data from child tables
GET http://localhost:4004/CatalogService/SalesOrders?$top=2&$expand=Items

###Reading data from CDS View
GET http://localhost:4004/CDSService/SOWorkList


